# Push langsung + perintah VPS

Setelah selesai mengubah kode (kecuali user bilang jangan commit):

1. Commit file relevan (tanpa `.env`, venv, `__pycache__`, uploads, backup).
2. `git push` ke branch yang sedang dilacak.
3. **Jangan** SSH/update VPS sendiri kecuali user memintanya secara eksplisit.
4. Di pesan ke user, selalu sertakan perintah VPS yang siap di-copy, sesuai jenis perubahan:

**Update lengkap (frontend + backend + deps/migrasi):**

```bash
ssh root@148.230.98.202
cd /var/www/bps-jne-dashboard
git pull
cd backend
./venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
./venv/bin/python -m alembic upgrade head
cd ../frontend
npm run build
sudo systemctl restart bps-api bps-celery bps-web
sudo systemctl is-active bps-api bps-celery bps-web
```

**Hanya backend (tanpa UI, tanpa paket/migrasi baru):**

```bash
ssh root@148.230.98.202
cd /var/www/bps-jne-dashboard
git pull
sudo systemctl restart bps-api bps-celery
```

**Hanya frontend:**

```bash
ssh root@148.230.98.202
cd /var/www/bps-jne-dashboard
git pull
cd frontend && npm run build
sudo systemctl restart bps-web
```

Sebutkan commit hash setelah push agar user bisa cek `git log -1 --oneline` di VPS.
